abstract: >
  Recommendation models can classify end-of-life electronics and rank circular
  pathways faster than India’s physical recovery system can execute them. This
  manuscript defines the AI–Physical Execution Gap (AIPEG), measures executability
  through availability, accessibility, capacity, viability, and legibility, and
  provides a reproducible geographic panel for Indian smartphone reverse logistics.
